{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"A small <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/succulent\" title=\"succulent\">succulent</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/fruit\" title=\"fruit\">fruit</a>, of any one of many varieties."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt32\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A soft fruit which <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/develop\" title=\"develop\">develops</a> from a single <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/ovary\" title=\"ovary\">ovary</a> and contains <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/seed\" title=\"seed\">seeds</a> not encased in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pit\" title=\"pit\">pits</a>."},{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/coffee_bean\" title=\"coffee bean\">coffee bean</a>."},{"definition":"One of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/ovum\" title=\"ovum\">ova</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/egg\" title=\"egg\">eggs</a> of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/fish\" title=\"fish\">fish</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/crustacean\" title=\"crustacean\">crustacean</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt38\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/police_car\" title=\"police car\">police car</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt40\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dollar\" title=\"dollar\">dollar</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"/wiki/berry#cite_ref-1\" rel=\"mw:referencedBy\"><span class=\"mw-linkback-text\">↑</span></a></span> <span id=\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1\" class=\"mw-reference-text reference-text\">Marlies Philippa et al., eds., <i>Etymologisch Woordenboek van het Nederlands</i>, A-Z, s.v. “bes” (Amsterdam UP, 3 Dec. 2009) <a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"http://www.etymologie.nl\" class=\"external autonumber\"></a>.</span>"},{"definition":"<span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"/wiki/berry#cite_ref-2\" rel=\"mw:referencedBy\"><span class=\"mw-linkback-text\">↑</span></a></span> <span id=\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2\" class=\"mw-reference-text reference-text\"><span class=\"citation-whole\" about=\"#mwt29\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><span class=\"cited-source\">“<a rel=\"mw:ExtLink nofollow\" href=\"https://greensdictofslang.com/entry/hm2zbiy\" class=\"external text\">berry<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span><i>n.</i></a>”, in <cite><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Green's%20Dictionary%20of%20Slang\" title=\"w:Green's Dictionary of Slang\" class=\"extiw\">Green’s Dictionary of Slang</a></cite>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jonathon%20Green\" title=\"w:Jonathon Green\" class=\"extiw\">Jonathon Green</a>, 2016–present.</span></span></span>"}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt235\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pick\" title=\"pick\">pick</a> berries.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"On summer days Grandma used to take us <b>berrying</b>, whether we wanted to go or not."}],"examples":["On summer days Grandma used to take us <b>berrying</b>, whether we wanted to go or not."]},{"definition":"To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/bear\" title=\"bear\">bear</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/produce\" title=\"produce\">produce</a> berries."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt282\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/mound\" title=\"mound\">mound</a>; a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/barrow\" title=\"barrow\">barrow</a>."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt286\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/burrow\" title=\"burrow\">burrow</a>, especially a rabbit's burrow."},{"definition":"An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/excavation\" title=\"excavation\">excavation</a>; a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/military\" title=\"military\">military</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/mine\" title=\"mine\">mine</a>."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt300\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/beat\" title=\"beat\">beat</a>; give a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/beating\" title=\"beating\">beating</a> to; <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/thrash\" title=\"thrash\">thrash</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt301\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/thresh\" title=\"thresh\">thresh</a> (grain)."}]}]}